s=51dedf82e9214c4f59dc39110449d75f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "■カリ太の長い大きいチンポと（竿役はチンポと舌のみ）交尾する性欲の強い【マスタード姉貴】\n\n・台詞と擬音\n・服装は3D衣装＋蛍光色紐パン\n資料 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZyTKziaQnCY&t=2330s\n・黒ずんだ乳輪と乳首は大きく母乳が出る\n・デカクリでビラビラが黒ずんだ使い込まれた肉厚なグロマン\n\n■シチュエーション\n・キスで大量の唾液を飲ませながら発情、乳首とデカクリの形が浮き上がる\n・乳を見せると乳首がペロペロされてビキビキと大きく勃起、母乳がピュッと出る\n↓\n・マンコを突きだして舐めるよう要求\n・広げられたマンコがペロペロされてデカクリがビキビキと大きく勃起\n・絶頂して噴き出した潮を飲ませるとチンポが痙攣して射精してしまう\n↓\n・勝手に射精したチンポを強くつかんでレロォと舐める\n・激しくしゃぶり勃起させる\n・口を離すと我慢汁が糸を引く\n↓\n・膣内に入るよう大きく口を開けたマンコから伸びるヨダレがトロォと亀頭に垂れる（背景にグパァと口を開ける子宮口）\n・チンポを飲み込み捕食して腹ボコ、軽く絶頂しながらパコパコ要求\n・激しく犯され乳を揺らして喘ぎ、イキそうになる\n・母乳噴射、舌出しンホ顔アクメでブシューッと潮吹き、中出し\n・舌舐めずりをしながら強い刺激に膣内から逃げ出そうと引き抜かれるチンポをひょっとこマンコで精子を吸い上げゾクゾクと快楽が込み上げる\n・グポッと亀頭が飛び出し大きく開いたままのマンコから精子がドパッと溢れてまた潮吹き絶頂\n・開いたマンコから伸びる太く濃いザーメンブリッジを眺めながら舐めて綺麗にするよう要求\n・シックスナインで中出しマンコを押し付けながら体力を消耗して弱ったチンポをしゃぶって交尾の続きをしようとする\n\n■※修正は黒線でおねがいします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mimic_ri/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a73111ff/uploads/origins/4baefad0-a203-41c5-b6e6-b536e42eb659?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9ff38f8b22d3c1589bd1480bf1f4947", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a73111ff/uploads/origins/4baefad0-a203-41c5-b6e6-b536e42eb659?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9ff38f8b22d3c1589bd1480bf1f4947, https://si.imgix.net/a73111ff/uploads/origins/4baefad0-a203-41c5-b6e6-b536e42eb659?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43ce006a19d8e3ea6f26aea1bc27f593 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a73111ff/uploads/origins/4baefad0-a203-41c5-b6e6-b536e42eb659?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c094ac97c8fda983ae0385726164dd3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello there,\nI'd like to request my kitsune OC, Miho.\nShe's a goddess of love and relationships but is single and very sloppy in private. Despite her being a mythical creature and a goddess, she loves modern technology, especially computers and video games.\nI would like her to be drawn in a style similar to one of your previous works (https://skeb.jp/@mimic_ri/works/8) where she is stretching and yawning in a way that makes her seem lazy. Please make her look a bit plump and give her messy hair. You can use the outfit in the pose reference or a different outfit, as long as it makes her look like a lazy otaku.\nFeel free to make adjustments where you see fit. I look forward to your work!\n\nMiho: https://photos.app.goo.gl/oGY5q8NHZAWvv1AUA\nPose: https://photos.app.goo.gl/9BAQKZmUiKuPRaDXA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mimic_ri/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d033315a/uploads/origins/6cfc417f-2611-4039-aa0a-ecc8a25a728e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b3e5b1b205c691cea670582cce014f19", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d033315a/uploads/origins/6cfc417f-2611-4039-aa0a-ecc8a25a728e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b3e5b1b205c691cea670582cce014f19, https://si.imgix.net/d033315a/uploads/origins/6cfc417f-2611-4039-aa0a-ecc8a25a728e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=66281ba619b79426c41fef20e28a81b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d033315a/uploads/origins/6cfc417f-2611-4039-aa0a-ecc8a25a728e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=031fd505104f832acb6fbe5cdac0ddec 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mimic_ri/works/8", "thumbnail_sr